## B2 — readTargetPath precedence (contract §7 amendment: existing shapes byte-identical)
readTargetPath rewrite paths -> "packages/a.ts"
readTargetPath search paths -> "packages/a.ts"
readTargetPath search docs-only -> "docs/b.md"
readTargetPath search path-key -> "docs/b.md"
readTargetPath search empty-paths+path -> "docs/b.md"
readTargetPath search nonarray-paths+path -> "docs/b.md"
readTargetPath read path -> "docs/a.md"
readTargetPath read file_path -> "docs/a.md"
readTargetPath read filePath -> "docs/a.md"
readTargetPath read target -> "docs/a.md"
readTargetPath read bare -> undefined
readTargetPath codegraph bare -> undefined
readTargetPath rewrite path-key only -> "docs/b.md"

